---
layout: layouts/base.njk
title: Reviews
metaTitle: "Reviews & Testimonials | Joel Dyter Cabinet Maker, Hebden Bridge"
description: "What clients say about Joel Dyter's handmade kitchens, staircases, doors and furniture."
permalink: /reviews/
---
<header class="page-hero page-hero--plain">
  <div class="container">
    <p class="eyebrow">Reviews</p>
    <h1 class="page-title">In clients' own words</h1>
    <p class="lede">Most of my work comes by word of mouth. Here's what some of my clients have said.</p>
    {% if site.googleReviewUrl %}<p><a class="btn btn--ghost" href="{{ site.googleReviewUrl }}" target="_blank" rel="noopener">Read &amp; leave reviews on Google</a></p>{% endif %}
  </div>
</header>
<section class="section section--tight">
  <div class="container reviews-list">
    {%- for t in testimonials.items %}
    <figure class="review">
      <div class="stars" aria-label="Five out of five">★★★★★</div>
      <blockquote>{% for para in t.quote.split("\n\n") %}<p>{{ para }}</p>{% endfor %}</blockquote>
      <figcaption>
        <strong>{{ t.name }}</strong>{% if t.place %}, {{ t.place }}{% endif %}
        {%- if t.project %} · <a href="/projects/{{ t.project }}/">see the project</a>{% endif %}
      </figcaption>
    </figure>
    {%- endfor %}
  </div>
</section>
{% include "partials/cta.njk" %}
